    "title": "Nuestro Diario: Noticias GT",
    "description": "Nuestro Diario is the news application for the chapines community in the United States to be informed and entertained, with the support of the largest newspaper in Guatemala. Easily find:\r\n\r\n- News from Guatemala and the Latin community in the US, the National Team and your favorite soccer teams\r\n- The digital version of Our Diary\r\n- Stories of chapines who have succeeded in the US.\r\n- Updated information on procedures in the US.\r\n- Events of the Chapina community in the USA.\r\n- Photos, videos and stories of the most relevant things in Guatemala\r\n- Family content\r\n- Games, entertainment and much more\r\n\r\nFor questions or comments, write to us by WhatsApp at +1 (302) 445-9136",
